. Поначалу все участники истории полны энтузиазма, однако, несмотря на совместное путешествие в Индию, куда Марта всегда мечтала попасть, стать настоящей семьей оказывается сложнее, чем Елена и Роман могли себе представить…","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1626590","ru":"A Touch of Distinction","en":"A Touch of Distinction","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aGqD4mZRbKzVSEyROduRN8P5LCz.jpg","genres":["вестерн"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1648710","ru":"Medora: Empress of the Badlands","en":"Medora: Empress of the Badlands","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mQZ4hxocf4JrAUyK5vVsQEkuJD8.jpg","genres":["драма","вестерн"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1568607","ru":"Konduktorių gatvėje","en":"Konduktorių gatvėje","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mZrg5eJkXkQcZxHBBU2PLMi1pTb.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1624042","ru":"Саша Незлобин: Думай как миллионер","en":"Саша Незлобин: Думай как миллионер","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rAj4FXSYNDngoWYvuyweBS1LL8I.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"Сольный стендап-концерт Саши Незлобина, записанный в 2025 году в Сан-Хосе (США).","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1616256","ru":"The Sandbox","en":"The Sandbox","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ivDelzVqxhBb0TAELCqAUQk0sPa.jpg","genres":[],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tm